  from text of from of this with name text of ob of this to name text output be chip do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip from name text source ob name text style to name text output be ceremony def
  from name of from of this with name text of ob of this to name text output be chip do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip from name text source ob text style be ceremony def
  from name of from of this ob text of ob of this to name text chip out be chip do
  su name chip out ret
prah

su name chip from name text source ob name text style be ceremony def
  from name of from of this ob name text of ob of this to name text chip out be chip do
  su name chip out ret
prah

su name chip from text source ob text style be ceremony def
  from text of from of this ob text of ob of this to name text chip out be chip do
  su name chip out ret
prah

su name chip from text source ob name text style be ceremony def
  from text of from of this ob name text of ob of this to name text chip out be chip do
  su name chip out ret
prah

su name chip from filename source ob text style to name text output be ceremony def
  from filename of from of this become wo text to name text chip source be read do
  from name text chip source ob text of ob of this to name text output be chip do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip from filename source ob name text style to name text output be ceremony def
  from filename of from of this become wo text to name text chip source be read do
  from name text chip source ob name text of ob of this to name text output be chip do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip from filename source ob text style be ceremony def
  from filename of from of this ob text of ob of this to name text chip out be chip do
  su name chip out ret
prah

su name chip from filename source ob name text style be ceremony def
  from filename of from of this ob name text of ob of this to name text chip out be chip do
  su name chip out ret
prah

exists su name chip be export ya
